  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rehabilitate a Poor School in a Village in Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project rehabilitates a poor rural school in in a village in Al-Abr district in Yemen including rehabilitation of 4 classrooms, 5 bathrooms and other maintenance in Al Amira school. The project comes to support the access of 388 vulnerable student (204 boys and 184 girls) to the school and provide support for 15 teachers through 15 teaching kits and incentives for their transportations to the village for a year.</narrative>
  </description>
